    {
      "beat_id": "BDEFS",
      "act": "DEFINITIONS",
      "lane": "CARD",
      "narration_text": "Three words before we start. Prompting: asking Claude, then reacting to whatever it produced — the prompt is a wish. Conducting: writing your decisions first — cases, rules, what counts as done — and handing them over. The prompt is a handoff, not the whole job. Spec: those decisions in writing, in one file Claude reads before it runs. That's the whole discipline. Three words. Watch what changes.",
      "estimated_duration_s": 24.3,
      "voice": "am_onyx",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice_kokoro": "am_onyx",
      "new_visual_element": "CCDefinitions — three terms",
